      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{6142bc91c830f70736b61114|full_name}: I was trying with grab, with laser move or searching for handle... the old menu style has visible handle below but new menu 2.0 has nothing visible except that lock icon. \nWhy is there lock icon if you can't move around?",
