  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2022-09-12T12:01:45.871Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "In Live with older menu, you added below the handle so menu panel can moved around.\nBut... new menu 2.0 has no more handle to move menu panel around. Even there is \"lock\" button lower-right.\nThis problem goes even more for chat keyboard. It popped so high in front of me, that person behind can even covered fully, made the interaction even more BAD.\nI really wish chat keyboard should pop up much lower or make it moveable.\nWho asked you to put keyboard so high? Nobody, and it blocks also visual view to other person, especially sign language will not visible. That is why put high is wrong design idea. The screenshot showed how wrong keyboard panel is placed in front of me.\nYou sure forgot we can look perfect down in VR (and slight lower for Desktop if can due our mouselook).",
